WEBVTT

01:38.120 --> 01:41.080
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.120 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 26]

01:44.560 --> 01:45.890
Let's hurry home.

01:45.920 --> 01:47.250
It's going to rain soon.

01:47.870 --> 01:48.479
Banxia,

01:49.640 --> 01:51.240
I have something to tell you.

01:53.150 --> 01:53.840
Can't we talk

01:53.840 --> 01:55.200
when we get home?

01:56.039 --> 01:56.900
Let's go first.

02:01.280 --> 02:02.480
Let's end this here.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.800
Do you

02:12.470 --> 02:13.960
still want to go fishing?

02:14.850 --> 02:16.290
Go ahead. It's fine.

02:16.680 --> 02:18.140
I'll just head home first.

02:19.030 --> 02:19.960
I'm serious.

02:31.190 --> 02:32.280
Why?

02:35.150 --> 02:37.310
Don't you like me a lot?

02:40.079 --> 02:41.280
I do like you a lot.

02:42.480 --> 02:43.740
You're kind and brave,

02:44.400 --> 02:45.960
with a likable personality.

02:45.960 --> 02:47.290
It's normal to like you.

02:48.120 --> 02:48.910
But Banxia,

02:49.630 --> 02:50.400
do you know?

02:50.950 --> 02:53.150
Liking someone has an expiration date.

02:54.750 --> 02:56.079
I liked you a moment ago,

02:56.190 --> 02:58.079
and I don't like you at this moment.

02:58.079 --> 03:00.280
I thought you were adorable and straightforward yesterday,

03:00.280 --> 03:01.430
but today I find you

03:01.590 --> 03:02.720
particularly wordy

03:02.870 --> 03:03.870
and troublesome.

03:04.080 --> 03:04.840
When you were always around me

03:04.840 --> 03:05.800
before,

03:06.310 --> 03:07.640
I found it quite lively.

03:08.460 --> 03:09.150
But now,

03:09.710 --> 03:10.800
suddenly, there's a group of people

03:10.800 --> 03:11.590
in your home.

03:12.410 --> 03:13.000
When I think of

03:13.000 --> 03:15.140
maintaining relationships with so many people,

03:15.140 --> 03:16.930
all those daily chores,

03:17.079 --> 03:19.030
and the bickering and trivial matters,

03:19.030 --> 03:21.360
I feel annoyed from the bottom of my heart.

03:21.430 --> 03:23.560
I don't want to deal with them anymore.

03:25.040 --> 03:25.840
I know

03:26.200 --> 03:27.560
that everything you said is a lie.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.560
You made it all up.

03:29.750 --> 03:30.710
I also know

03:31.160 --> 03:32.150
that you're angry with me,

03:32.150 --> 03:33.130
my father,

03:33.150 --> 03:34.270
and Li Xian.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.310
But I've also told you

03:36.810 --> 03:38.470
I'll cancel this engagement.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.030
And...

03:39.430 --> 03:41.190
And my father has also promised me

03:41.190 --> 03:42.430
that he'll break off the engagement as soon as possible.

03:42.430 --> 03:44.000
Can you wait a little longer?

03:44.000 --> 03:45.660
It has nothing to do with this.

03:45.910 --> 03:47.400
Then what is it about?

03:52.520 --> 03:54.380
It's not that reason again, is it?

03:54.800 --> 03:56.560
You think that because you're a demon hunter,

03:56.560 --> 03:57.360
being with you

03:57.370 --> 03:58.650
will put me in danger.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.190
You can't protect me properly.

04:00.190 --> 04:01.030
But I've told you

04:01.030 --> 04:01.750
many times

04:01.750 --> 04:03.350
that I don't care about that.

04:03.520 --> 04:04.800
But I do care.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.150
Banxia,

04:07.750 --> 04:09.240
how can you be so reckless?

04:09.800 --> 04:10.960
Do you know what I face

04:10.960 --> 04:11.710
every day?

04:12.360 --> 04:13.160
In this world,

04:13.430 --> 04:14.450
there are many more dangerous and cunning demons

04:14.450 --> 04:15.240
than Chi Wangchuan,

04:15.240 --> 04:15.960
Feng Wuniang,

04:15.960 --> 04:17.360
and Moon-Fearing Demon.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.390
They eat raw meat and drink blood,

04:19.390 --> 04:21.040
driven by their bestial nature.

04:21.040 --> 04:22.190
When they go berserk,

04:22.190 --> 04:22.950
they don't even recognize themselves

04:22.950 --> 04:24.410
or know what they've done.

04:24.830 --> 04:26.560
They would even treat their closest kin

04:26.560 --> 04:27.760
as food to devour.

04:28.390 --> 04:29.830
How can you be sure

04:30.120 --> 04:30.630
you won't encounter

04:30.630 --> 04:32.920
these things I face every day in the future?

04:32.920 --> 04:34.040
I won't.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.490
You will protect me.

04:42.680 --> 04:44.210
What if I can't protect you?

04:48.270 --> 04:49.200
It's very likely

04:49.600 --> 04:51.530
that you'll wake up one day and find

04:52.270 --> 04:53.040
I'm gone.

04:53.620 --> 04:55.190
I might fall into someone else's trap.

04:55.190 --> 04:55.950
I might

04:55.950 --> 04:57.750
suddenly appear in the mountains,

04:57.750 --> 04:58.630
or possibly

04:59.000 --> 05:00.360
end up somewhere I can't see you

05:00.360 --> 05:01.560
or protect you.

05:02.480 --> 05:04.080
I can't even protect myself.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.560
How can I protect you?

05:06.040 --> 05:08.000
Don't say such unpleasant things.

05:08.830 --> 05:10.160
You're suddenly like this today.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.120
Is it because my father

05:11.120 --> 05:12.270
said something to you?

05:12.270 --> 05:13.400
Don't listen to him.

05:14.000 --> 05:14.630
Banxia,

05:17.040 --> 05:18.440
please stay away from me.

05:19.770 --> 05:20.390
You shouldn't be with

05:20.390 --> 05:21.560
a demon hunter.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.020
While we still have the chance

05:25.560 --> 05:26.890
and can still turn back,

05:27.950 --> 05:28.950
let's end it here,

05:29.720 --> 05:30.400
okay?

05:33.750 --> 05:34.830
I don't want to.

05:39.560 --> 05:40.190
Banxia,

05:41.430 --> 05:42.750
everything will pass.

05:44.340 --> 05:45.220
In this world,

05:45.920 --> 05:47.630
nothing lasts forever.

05:49.460 --> 05:50.830
As time goes by,

05:51.920 --> 05:53.270
feelings will fade,

05:53.830 --> 05:55.560
or even disappear completely.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.130
You just need some time.

05:57.870 --> 05:58.930
After this period,

05:59.830 --> 06:01.230
everything will be fine.

06:06.250 --> 06:07.090
Why?

06:09.270 --> 06:10.070
What makes you think

06:10.070 --> 06:12.070
things will be fine after some time?

06:13.070 --> 06:14.730
I came all this way to find you today,

06:14.730 --> 06:16.420
because I was worried you might be unhappy.

06:16.420 --> 06:17.600
I traveled such a long distance.

06:17.600 --> 06:18.830
I searched for you for so long.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.030
It's almost dark now.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.510
After I finally arrived,

06:21.510 --> 06:23.020
you started preaching to me,

06:23.020 --> 06:23.800
without caring about my feelings,

06:23.800 --> 06:24.750
trying to force me to believe what you said.

06:24.750 --> 06:25.480
Why should I?

06:26.800 --> 06:28.330
Jiu Xuanye, let me tell you,

06:28.830 --> 06:30.770
it's true that you've done me a great favor,

06:30.770 --> 06:32.360
but a relationship involves two people.

06:32.360 --> 06:33.430
It's not that you can do

06:33.430 --> 06:34.510
whatever you want.

06:45.350 --> 06:48.880
♫Melody echoes along the river; wild geese soar in sudden fright♫

06:49.360 --> 06:52.040
♫The music ends, and I stand in solitude♫

06:53.680 --> 06:56.909
♫I see you turn into a handful of starlight♫

06:57.390 --> 07:01.220
♫Drifting past me♫

07:01.680 --> 07:05.470
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

07:05.830 --> 07:08.970
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

07:09.130 --> 07:13.720
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

07:14.110 --> 07:16.120
♫But why did you♫

07:16.430 --> 07:20.720
♫Still endure the pain and shatter♫

07:21.060 --> 07:25.550
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

07:25.650 --> 07:29.330
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

07:29.610 --> 07:31.550
♫I hate that I failed♫

07:31.580 --> 07:36.900
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

07:37.270 --> 07:41.470
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

07:41.500 --> 07:46.360
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

07:46.900 --> 07:53.080
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

08:05.670 --> 08:09.850
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

08:10.070 --> 08:13.960
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

08:14.240 --> 08:16.170
♫I hate that I failed♫

08:16.220 --> 08:21.600
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

08:21.860 --> 08:26.310
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

08:26.330 --> 08:31.140
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

08:31.620 --> 08:37.620
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

08:38.390 --> 08:39.000
Banxia.

08:42.240 --> 08:42.750
Banxia.

08:54.100 --> 08:54.700
Banxia.

09:00.720 --> 09:01.360
Master.

09:03.670 --> 09:06.000
I'm bringing a bowl of ginger soup for her.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.720
My Lady,

09:28.500 --> 09:30.160
please have some ginger soup.

09:33.400 --> 09:35.000
I'm asleep. I don't want any.

09:56.510 --> 09:57.030
Chi Xue.

09:57.140 --> 09:58.070
Where's Xuanye?

09:58.620 --> 09:59.480
He's sleeping.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.450
What are you doing?

10:01.550 --> 10:02.480
Looking for him.

10:02.960 --> 10:03.760
He's not here.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.120
Didn't you just say he was sleeping?

10:06.120 --> 10:07.270
How come he's not here now?

10:07.270 --> 10:07.840
Tell me first,

10:07.840 --> 10:09.370
why are you looking for him?

10:09.560 --> 10:11.000
There's a situation at Fa'en Temple.

10:11.000 --> 10:12.600
Youhuang sent me to find him.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.370
Why didn't Youhuang come himself?

10:15.480 --> 10:17.080
Youhuang is at Fa'en Temple.

10:17.670 --> 10:19.470
You should have said so earlier.

10:30.480 --> 10:32.470
Thank you for your trouble, Physician Jiu.

10:32.470 --> 10:33.730
Where is the deceased?

10:33.790 --> 10:34.390
Inside.

10:37.150 --> 10:38.550
Since there's been a murder,

10:38.550 --> 10:40.410
why haven't you cleared the area?

10:41.390 --> 10:43.120
There are too many worshippers.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.150
If we clear them out,

10:44.150 --> 10:46.030
it will cause a commotion, and everyone will know.

10:46.030 --> 10:47.200
Last time we caught the Mirror Demon,

10:47.200 --> 10:48.600
we made too much of a fuss.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.080
It caused the lord

10:49.080 --> 10:50.390
to be reported by his colleagues.

10:50.390 --> 10:52.120
Now we can only act discreetly.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.840
You four stay outside.

10:57.320 --> 10:58.030
-Yes.
-Yes.

11:03.840 --> 11:04.510
The incense burning at Fa'en Temple

11:04.510 --> 11:06.100
has always been quite brisk.

11:06.100 --> 11:07.230
But for some reason,

11:07.480 --> 11:08.670
in the past two years, rumor has it that

11:08.670 --> 11:09.600
wishes made here

11:09.860 --> 11:10.770
are especially easy

11:10.770 --> 11:11.540
to come true.

11:12.120 --> 11:12.670
Over time,

11:12.670 --> 11:13.960
even worshippers from other places

11:13.960 --> 11:15.620
have come here to make wishes.

11:16.870 --> 11:17.800
There's a snake!

11:23.960 --> 11:25.890
Don't be afraid of the snakes here.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.120
They're all from the nearby mountains.

11:27.120 --> 11:29.200
Everyone says the snakes at Fa'en Temple

11:29.200 --> 11:31.260
understand the Buddhist teachings.

11:31.630 --> 11:33.230
Big snakes don't come. Look,

11:33.240 --> 11:34.150
they're all small snakes.

11:34.150 --> 11:35.680
And they never harm people.

11:36.200 --> 11:37.460
This further confirms

11:37.630 --> 11:40.150
the notion that Fa'en Temple's Buddhist teachings are profound.

11:40.150 --> 11:40.750
Everyone believes

11:40.750 --> 11:42.150
it's an auspicious sign.

11:45.200 --> 11:45.730
Let's go.

12:02.870 --> 12:03.870
I've examined it.

12:04.080 --> 12:04.960
It's not poisoning.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.240
There are no fatal wounds.

12:06.240 --> 12:08.420
I can't see any signs of illness either.

12:08.420 --> 12:09.090
This morning, the temple

12:09.090 --> 12:10.640
notified her husband's relatives,

12:10.640 --> 12:11.910
who immediately rushed to the government office

12:11.910 --> 12:12.870
to transfer the property deed.

12:12.870 --> 12:14.870
That's when I found out she had died.

12:15.110 --> 12:16.550
I think this matter is suspicious.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.550
So I asked you to come and take a look.

12:26.000 --> 12:27.330
As for Zhang Pu's death,

12:27.510 --> 12:29.960
Xingxian hasn't been cleared of suspicion yet.

12:29.960 --> 12:31.360
Now Xingxian is dead too.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.740
Can you determine the cause of death?

12:38.000 --> 12:39.550
I can't tell just by examining like this.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.680
I need to perform an autopsy to be sure.

12:42.420 --> 12:44.480
I won't trouble you with the autopsy.

12:44.790 --> 12:46.390
I just want you to check for me

12:46.550 --> 12:49.410
whether this matter has anything to do with demons.

12:50.030 --> 12:52.150
You're really once bitten,

12:52.360 --> 12:53.620
twice shy, aren't you?

12:54.210 --> 12:55.760
I've already investigated

12:55.790 --> 12:56.910
three cases for you this month.

12:56.910 --> 12:57.550
For every single case,

12:57.550 --> 12:59.610
you claimed it was related to demons.

12:59.670 --> 13:01.270
I need to rule out this factor first

13:01.270 --> 13:02.960
before I can investigate normally.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.270
If we investigate thoroughly

13:04.270 --> 13:05.620
and it turns out to be the work of demons,

13:05.620 --> 13:07.420
wouldn't our efforts be in vain?

13:11.600 --> 13:12.120
Also,

13:12.750 --> 13:14.030
her husband's relatives

13:14.030 --> 13:15.430
are in a hurry to bury her.

13:15.670 --> 13:17.330
If we can't produce evidence,

13:17.640 --> 13:18.100
I can't hold onto the body

13:18.100 --> 13:19.190
for a long time

13:19.270 --> 13:20.930
without returning it to them.

13:28.630 --> 13:29.270
My Lady,

13:29.750 --> 13:31.270
Mr. Li just came by.

13:31.550 --> 13:32.470
He heard you were ill

13:32.470 --> 13:33.480
and wanted to come to the back courtyard for a visit,

13:33.480 --> 13:34.810
but Madam sent him away.

13:36.440 --> 13:38.120
I also heard Master say

13:38.360 --> 13:39.760
that Mr. Li came this time

13:40.130 --> 13:41.860
to compose some musical scores

13:42.180 --> 13:43.510
for the imperial court.

13:43.840 --> 13:44.120
My Lady,

13:44.120 --> 13:45.630
if someone like Mr. Li

13:45.650 --> 13:46.980
can become an official,

13:47.080 --> 13:49.610
it seems quite easy to become one, doesn't it?

13:50.120 --> 13:51.410
Who cares what kind of official he becomes?

13:51.410 --> 13:52.940
It has nothing to do with me.

13:54.390 --> 13:55.150
My Lady,

13:57.270 --> 13:58.480
did you have a fight

13:58.480 --> 13:59.610
with Physician Jiu?

14:03.240 --> 14:04.000
Is he upset

14:04.030 --> 14:05.750
because of Mr. Li?

14:07.050 --> 14:07.810
I don't know.

14:10.290 --> 14:10.880
My Lady,

14:10.910 --> 14:13.200
there's something I've been wanting to say.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.000
Seeing you were in high spirits,

14:15.390 --> 14:16.510
I've held it back.

14:18.390 --> 14:20.650
The way you interact with Physician Jiu,

14:20.720 --> 14:21.840
isn't it too hasty?

14:27.960 --> 14:29.360
Really? I don't think so.

14:30.390 --> 14:32.150
As the saying goes,

14:33.080 --> 14:34.030
the easier something is

14:34.030 --> 14:35.120
to obtain,

14:35.140 --> 14:36.340
the less it's valued.

14:36.670 --> 14:37.360
Look at you,

14:37.910 --> 14:40.360
as soon as you wake up, you rush to the next door.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.150
You're either making soup

14:41.150 --> 14:42.350
or preparing snacks.

14:42.670 --> 14:44.120
A young lady like you

14:44.170 --> 14:45.840
is living like an old nanny.

14:46.370 --> 14:47.890
If I were Physician Jiu,

14:48.410 --> 14:48.960
as time goes by,

14:48.960 --> 14:51.090
I wouldn't take you seriously either.

14:51.950 --> 14:53.140
I'm not like that.

14:55.510 --> 14:57.990
You should learn from Madam in this regard.

15:00.550 --> 15:01.440
My mother?

15:01.960 --> 15:03.160
Haven't you noticed?

15:03.630 --> 15:05.120
Since Madam returned,

15:05.150 --> 15:06.140
your status in our household

15:06.140 --> 15:07.310
has plummeted.

15:07.670 --> 15:09.790
You used to be the apple of the Master's eye,

15:09.790 --> 15:11.260
but now you're dispensable.

15:11.260 --> 15:13.910
He didn't even remember to wait for you at meals.

15:13.910 --> 15:14.670
Really?

15:15.690 --> 15:17.820
My Lady, you need to be more observant.

15:18.190 --> 15:20.050
Even though Master suffered a lot

15:20.070 --> 15:21.380
for Madam this time,

15:22.390 --> 15:23.030
Madam

15:23.060 --> 15:24.430
didn't act like you,

15:24.790 --> 15:25.630
all grateful and indebted,

15:25.630 --> 15:26.910
like a little maid.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.360
They're married.

15:29.630 --> 15:31.550
Of course, it's Master's duty to save her.

15:31.550 --> 15:33.440
I once overheard them arguing.

15:33.810 --> 15:35.510
Madam even complained that he came too late.

15:35.510 --> 15:36.870
Is that true?

15:37.910 --> 15:38.550
It's true.

15:39.550 --> 15:40.390
So,

15:40.790 --> 15:42.790
you should learn from Madam.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.840
You need to learn to use some tricks.

15:48.150 --> 15:50.440
Use some tricks?

15:52.480 --> 15:53.280
Let me ask you,

15:53.750 --> 15:54.480
yesterday,

15:54.670 --> 15:56.510
you had a fight with Physician Jiu.

15:56.510 --> 15:58.080
What should you do

15:58.870 --> 16:00.670
if he comes to you for an apology?

16:01.670 --> 16:03.510
I should...

16:05.510 --> 16:06.180
Ignore him.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.080
Yes.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.840
When two people are together,

16:09.840 --> 16:11.970
it's important to see who can hold out.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.510
If you can, you'll win.

16:14.030 --> 16:15.160
You want

16:15.180 --> 16:16.510
to marry Physician Jiu.

16:16.790 --> 16:18.550
If you want to have a good life together,

16:18.550 --> 16:21.030
you need to establish the rules first.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.750
Don't be swayed by a few sweet words,

16:22.750 --> 16:24.480
or you'll lose your head again.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.000
You're right.

16:27.390 --> 16:28.830
Even if he comes to me

16:28.850 --> 16:30.150
and begs me to pardon him,

16:30.150 --> 16:31.600
I will never forgive him.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.800
At least I have to hold out for...

16:37.600 --> 16:38.270
Two days.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.670
That's right.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.270
Banxia!

16:46.150 --> 16:46.910
Banxia!

16:48.150 --> 16:48.910
Banxia!

16:49.350 --> 16:50.510
Xuanye is looking for you!

16:50.510 --> 16:51.310
Come quickly!

16:53.240 --> 16:53.840
My Lady!

16:57.630 --> 16:58.270
Xuanye.

16:59.670 --> 17:00.530
Banxia is here.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.740
Why did you call for me?

17:06.000 --> 17:06.900
I heard from a friend

17:06.900 --> 17:08.160
of yours, surnamed Xu,

17:08.240 --> 17:10.460
that you went to Sanhuai Lane a few days ago

17:10.460 --> 17:11.460
and saw Xingxian.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.480
That's right.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.490
She was bullied

17:14.490 --> 17:15.490
and beaten badly.

17:15.800 --> 17:16.960
Zhizhi and I stood up for her.

17:16.960 --> 17:17.760
What's wrong?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.589
On her body,

17:19.869 --> 17:21.200
did you see a white crow?

17:22.200 --> 17:22.750
No.

17:27.000 --> 17:27.800
Why do you ask?

17:28.830 --> 17:29.680
She died.

17:31.590 --> 17:32.920
Think carefully again.

17:33.400 --> 17:34.720
Are you sure you didn't see

17:34.720 --> 17:36.050
a white crow on her body?

17:37.160 --> 17:38.620
I'm certain there wasn't.

17:38.980 --> 17:40.380
If there's no white crow,

17:40.440 --> 17:41.440
what does it mean?

17:43.030 --> 17:44.560
It means she's not dead yet.

17:49.240 --> 17:50.370
Where are you going?

17:50.400 --> 17:51.070
Banxia,

17:51.440 --> 17:52.240
we're going to investigate the case.

17:52.240 --> 17:54.370
I'll explain in detail after I return.

17:57.000 --> 17:57.790
Xuanye!

18:07.830 --> 18:09.070
When we had just left,

18:09.880 --> 18:11.080
they buried the body.

18:13.140 --> 18:13.960
Her husband's relatives

18:13.960 --> 18:14.970
wanted her house

18:15.350 --> 18:16.760
and couldn't wait for her to die.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.490
We don't have

18:17.500 --> 18:18.700
Lord Geng's warrant.

18:19.000 --> 18:19.960
And this case

18:20.130 --> 18:21.790
really has no points of doubt,

18:22.510 --> 18:25.570
so naturally we can't go against her families' wishes.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.280
It's done.

18:37.160 --> 18:37.680
Chi Xue,

18:38.110 --> 18:38.640
open it.

18:39.160 --> 18:39.640
Got it.

18:57.650 --> 18:58.320
She's gone?

19:38.200 --> 19:39.030
Where am I?

19:39.960 --> 19:41.090
How did I end up here?

20:09.950 --> 20:10.830
This isn't me.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.040
How could I...

20:14.070 --> 20:15.930
How could I have turned into a man?

20:18.170 --> 20:20.450
[Chilian]

20:28.350 --> 20:30.550
To think she escaped by faking her death.

20:30.550 --> 20:32.830
Could it be that Xingxian is a demon?

20:34.110 --> 20:35.680
I don't know if she's a demon or not,

20:35.680 --> 20:37.940
but she's definitely related to demons.

20:38.090 --> 20:39.440
And she must have something to do

20:39.440 --> 20:40.700
with Zhang Pu's death.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.110
I understand.

20:43.550 --> 20:45.000
I'll send more men when I get back

20:45.000 --> 20:48.060
to search the entire city for Xingxian's whereabouts.

20:50.110 --> 20:50.880
Five portions.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.440
Alright.

20:52.270 --> 20:52.960
Xuanye.

20:53.290 --> 20:53.770
Chi Xue.

20:54.880 --> 20:55.920
What a coincidence!

20:55.920 --> 20:56.750
When I left home today,

20:56.750 --> 20:58.550
I was wondering if I'd run into you.

20:58.550 --> 20:59.480
I turned around,

20:59.590 --> 21:00.520
and here you are.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.580
It must be fate.

21:01.920 --> 21:03.050
Where are you off to?

21:04.110 --> 21:06.570
To take care of some matters with my friends.

21:07.960 --> 21:08.440
I see.

21:08.830 --> 21:10.270
Then I won't ask any more questions.

21:10.270 --> 21:11.790
Xuanye is a man who is capable of achieving great things.

21:11.790 --> 21:13.070
Some things can't be spoken of,

21:13.070 --> 21:14.130
can't be spoken of.

21:14.350 --> 21:15.590
Oh, by the way, Xuanye,

21:15.590 --> 21:17.120
I'm about to visit a master.

21:17.270 --> 21:18.510
His skills to play the Qin are unparalleled.

21:18.510 --> 21:20.130
You could say each of his tunes is worth a thousand gold pieces,

21:20.130 --> 21:21.160
and that wouldn't be an exaggeration.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.000
What do you say?

21:22.000 --> 21:22.860
Care to join me?

21:24.200 --> 21:25.640
I still have some matters to attend to,

21:25.640 --> 21:26.770
so I'll have to pass.

21:27.070 --> 21:28.530
Well, how about tomorrow?

21:30.790 --> 21:32.790
I have things to do tomorrow as well.

21:33.030 --> 21:33.510
Well...

21:35.250 --> 21:36.090
I'll get going then.

21:36.090 --> 21:37.400
Well, then, let's do it another day,

21:37.400 --> 21:37.880
Xuanye.

21:38.100 --> 21:39.030
Chi Xue, Chi Xue.

21:39.920 --> 21:41.380
I have a favor to ask of you.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.030
One of the two bags of nuts

21:43.030 --> 21:44.110
is for you guys,

21:44.130 --> 21:45.030
and as for the other, please help me

21:45.030 --> 21:45.920
deliver it to Banxia.

21:45.920 --> 21:46.550
Thank you.

21:47.030 --> 21:48.350
Well, don't you want to keep one for yourself?

21:48.350 --> 21:48.800
It's fine.

21:48.800 --> 21:49.930
I'll buy some later.

21:50.440 --> 21:50.970
Alright.

21:51.200 --> 21:51.800
Farewell.

21:53.480 --> 21:55.210
This person is so troublesome.

21:55.350 --> 21:56.610
Is he Xuanye's friend?

21:56.880 --> 21:57.400
No,

21:57.590 --> 21:58.450
it's Banxia's.

21:59.350 --> 22:00.350
Banxia's friend.

22:00.550 --> 22:01.720
Banxia's fiancé.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.350
Banxia has a fiancé?

22:10.070 --> 22:10.530
Well...

22:13.590 --> 22:14.640
Go by yourself?

22:16.160 --> 22:16.960
My Lady,

22:17.510 --> 22:18.860
since you came back from the Underground City,

22:18.860 --> 22:20.720
you've become bolder and bolder.

22:20.960 --> 22:22.090
What's the big deal?

22:23.030 --> 22:24.560
Breaking off an engagement

22:24.750 --> 22:26.480
is usually handled by parents.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.580
Yet you're going by yourself.

22:28.680 --> 22:30.240
Moreover, you and Physician Jiu

22:30.240 --> 22:31.900
haven't even reconciled yet.

22:32.150 --> 22:33.610
Has he agreed to marry you?

22:35.000 --> 22:35.480
Not yet.

22:36.350 --> 22:37.400
But whether I break off the engagement or not

22:37.400 --> 22:38.880
has nothing to do with him.

22:39.070 --> 22:40.160
Even without him,

22:40.160 --> 22:41.480
I won't marry Li Xian.

22:42.510 --> 22:44.310
His current awkward behavior

22:44.510 --> 22:46.110
must be related to my father.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.480
He must be

22:47.480 --> 22:48.480
fantasizing about

22:48.480 --> 22:49.740
my marriage to Li Xian.

22:49.760 --> 22:51.000
It's better for me to break off the engagement myself

22:51.000 --> 22:52.860
than to wait for him to do it for me.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.830
What about Physician Jiu?

22:56.400 --> 22:57.930
His issues are even bigger.

22:58.160 --> 22:59.420
But let's wait for now.

22:59.520 --> 23:00.520
I'll deal with him

23:00.540 --> 23:01.310
after I take care of

23:01.310 --> 23:02.370
the matter at hand.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.200
That makes sense.

23:05.510 --> 23:06.640
Time waits for no one.

23:06.640 --> 23:07.480
I'm going now.

23:28.750 --> 23:30.480
In lieu of wine, I offer this tea

23:30.480 --> 23:31.680
to toast you, Mr. Bai.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.850
I haven't asked yet

23:37.960 --> 23:40.200
what brought you to Guangping.

23:41.590 --> 23:42.830
Taking advantage of official business

23:42.830 --> 23:44.400
to visit my future in-laws.

23:45.400 --> 23:46.110
So,

23:46.110 --> 23:47.570
you've found a good match.

23:47.880 --> 23:48.940
Congratulations.

23:49.440 --> 23:50.740
Not married yet.

23:51.200 --> 23:52.860
But thank you anyway, Mr. Bai.

23:53.550 --> 23:55.210
I came to Guangping this time,

23:55.270 --> 23:57.310
so I can fortunately meet you again, Mr. Bai.

23:57.310 --> 23:58.110
Two years ago,

23:58.200 --> 23:59.800
your masterful performance

24:00.240 --> 24:01.840
left a deep impression on me.

24:02.270 --> 24:03.930
Unfortunately, I was tied up with trivial matters then

24:03.930 --> 24:05.550
and couldn't learn more from you.

24:05.550 --> 24:06.400
So this time,

24:06.400 --> 24:08.160
I've taken the liberty of visiting you.

24:08.160 --> 24:09.020
You flatter me.

24:13.070 --> 24:14.680
Those snakes are suspicious.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.810
They're being controlled by someone.

24:17.960 --> 24:18.550
The reason why

24:18.550 --> 24:19.920
I didn't tell Youhuang much

24:19.920 --> 24:21.830
is that I'm afraid he might alert our target.

24:21.830 --> 24:22.720
We'll investigate

24:22.720 --> 24:23.780
this matter first.

24:25.070 --> 24:25.680
We?

24:27.070 --> 24:27.680
Yes,

24:28.400 --> 24:29.110
you and I.

24:29.830 --> 24:31.890
You're asking a rabbit to investigate snakes?

24:31.890 --> 24:32.790
Why don't you ask a peach

24:32.790 --> 24:34.650
to keep an eye on Monkey Mountain?

24:35.520 --> 24:36.380
I'm asking you to investigate the case,

24:36.380 --> 24:37.830
not to fight them.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.270
From now on,

24:42.510 --> 24:43.550
sleep a little less

24:43.550 --> 24:44.410
and stay alert.

24:47.720 --> 24:48.980
I always have a feeling

24:49.400 --> 24:51.660
that the demon this time is not ordinary.

24:55.050 --> 24:56.560
Please don't see me out, Mr. Bai.

24:56.560 --> 24:57.440
I'll take my leave.

24:57.440 --> 25:03.050
[Spring Trees and Evening Clouds]

25:26.880 --> 25:27.350
Who...

25:28.110 --> 25:29.540
Who exactly are you?

25:31.070 --> 25:32.200
To others,

25:32.470 --> 25:33.470
my surname is Bai.

25:33.680 --> 25:34.790
I'm a Qin master.

25:36.050 --> 25:37.840
Few people know my real name.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.110
However,

25:40.750 --> 25:41.880
I can tell you.

25:44.350 --> 25:45.410
My name is Chilian.

25:48.310 --> 25:49.790
Mr. Chilian...

25:51.590 --> 25:52.140
Why...

25:54.550 --> 25:55.790
Why would I become

25:55.810 --> 25:56.870
like this?

25:57.720 --> 25:59.450
Isn't this what you wished for?

26:00.030 --> 26:01.690
That day at Fa'en Temple, you made a wish

26:01.690 --> 26:02.850
to become a man.

26:03.440 --> 26:04.970
Now your wish has come true.

26:05.160 --> 26:06.550
You should be happy.

26:06.830 --> 26:08.110
How did you know?

26:10.030 --> 26:11.290
Are you a Bodhisattva?

26:12.610 --> 26:13.440
I'm just a passerby

26:13.440 --> 26:14.570
who does a good deed.

26:15.000 --> 26:16.880
I dare not claim the title of Bodhisattva.

26:16.880 --> 26:17.640
Then...

26:19.160 --> 26:20.400
Are you an immortal?

26:22.480 --> 26:23.160
Or...

26:26.610 --> 26:27.400
Or...

26:28.790 --> 26:29.830
I can tell you,

26:30.960 --> 26:32.110
but don't be afraid.

27:52.000 --> 27:53.310
You're far from being honest.

27:53.310 --> 27:54.400
You don't keep your word.

27:54.400 --> 27:55.750
You just ran away like that.

27:55.750 --> 27:57.210
You think I won't kill you?

27:57.240 --> 27:58.040
That's right.

27:58.400 --> 27:59.720
If you want to kill me, then do it.

27:59.720 --> 28:00.370
If you kill me,

28:00.370 --> 28:01.880
let's see how you can find Xuanye.

28:01.880 --> 28:02.940
If I can't find him,

28:03.130 --> 28:04.060
I won't let you go.

28:04.060 --> 28:06.030
Stop wasting your breath on me, boy.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.760
You want me to betray my friend?

28:08.510 --> 28:09.350
Dream on.

28:52.950 --> 28:54.950
You've got guts, I'll give you that.

29:30.210 --> 29:31.140
Blood for blood.

29:31.510 --> 29:32.170
Eye for eye.

29:32.590 --> 29:33.390
Life for life.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.480
Soul for soul.

29:34.650 --> 29:35.530
Black covers the black head.

29:35.530 --> 29:36.720
Cloud conceals the cloud tail.

29:36.720 --> 29:37.930
Demon Ancestors are supreme.

29:37.930 --> 29:40.790
The world is in the primal chaos of heaven and earth.

29:42.210 --> 29:43.720
I wonder where Mr. Li

29:43.750 --> 29:44.720
has gone off to.

29:45.590 --> 29:47.520
He's always running out and about.

29:47.830 --> 29:48.510
Gosh.

29:49.870 --> 29:51.720
And it seems he has more acquaintances in Guangping

29:51.720 --> 29:52.880
than we do.

29:55.880 --> 29:56.790
Physician Jiu.

30:06.170 --> 30:06.680
It's so late.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.340
Why are you just getting back?

30:08.880 --> 30:10.510
We went to look for Mr. Li,

30:10.590 --> 30:11.720
but he wasn't there.

30:11.750 --> 30:12.640
We waited for a long time,

30:12.640 --> 30:13.880
so we came back late.

30:20.680 --> 30:21.440
Do you want to know

30:21.440 --> 30:22.770
why I went to see Li Xian?

30:25.540 --> 30:26.580
I won't tell you.

30:32.970 --> 30:35.370
I went to break off the engagement with him.

30:38.110 --> 30:39.110
Break off the engagement?

30:39.110 --> 30:39.550
Yeah.

30:40.880 --> 30:41.940
But let me be clear,

30:41.960 --> 30:42.480
my breaking off the engagement

30:42.480 --> 30:43.420
has nothing to do with you

30:43.420 --> 30:44.010
at all.

30:44.090 --> 30:45.110
Even before I met you,

30:45.110 --> 30:46.640
I didn't agree to this marriage.

30:46.640 --> 30:47.690
No one can force me

30:47.720 --> 30:49.240
to do something I don't want to do.

30:49.240 --> 30:50.240
So no matter what,

30:50.270 --> 30:53.530
I'm definitely going to break off the engagement with him.

30:59.550 --> 31:00.880
What do you mean by "oh"?

31:03.070 --> 31:03.830
It just means

31:04.350 --> 31:05.150
I understand.

31:12.640 --> 31:13.200
Let me tell you,

31:13.200 --> 31:14.480
don't be too smug.

31:14.680 --> 31:16.210
I won't keep pestering you.

31:16.230 --> 31:17.590
What's so great about you anyway?

31:17.590 --> 31:18.400
You're so boring.

31:18.400 --> 31:19.800
Your personality is odd.

31:19.840 --> 31:21.630
And your mood changes at the drop of a hat.

31:21.630 --> 31:22.440
Even if I break off the engagement,

31:22.440 --> 31:23.440
I won't marry you.

31:23.440 --> 31:23.980
If I end up being alone,

31:23.980 --> 31:25.380
I won't marry you either.

31:25.400 --> 31:27.080
It's okay that you don't like me.

31:27.080 --> 31:28.410
I don't like you either.

31:31.790 --> 31:33.220
And I think you're right.

31:33.370 --> 31:34.720
I like to eat Chinese toon today,

31:34.720 --> 31:35.350
but maybe,

31:35.510 --> 31:37.350
I'd prefer to eat pastries tomorrow.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.790
It's not like I'll always like the same thing.

31:38.790 --> 31:39.310
Later on, perhaps,

31:39.310 --> 31:40.440
I'll enjoy eating sumptuous meals.

31:40.440 --> 31:42.200
I'll eat whatever is delicious.

31:42.200 --> 31:43.000
I certainly

31:43.000 --> 31:43.750
won't keep crying and whining

31:43.750 --> 31:45.280
and making a fool of myself.

31:45.510 --> 31:47.310
You're overthinking it. You...

31:50.750 --> 31:51.610
Physician Jiu.

31:53.690 --> 31:54.890
Xuanye, are you okay?

31:56.510 --> 31:57.710
Xuanye, are you okay?

31:58.550 --> 31:59.550
Xuanye.

32:27.030 --> 32:27.750
Xuanye.

32:30.480 --> 32:32.140
What happened to you just now?

32:41.680 --> 32:42.790
What is this place?

32:43.880 --> 32:45.070
Is this Shendu City?

32:45.810 --> 32:47.480
Shendu City?

32:48.590 --> 32:49.450
Physician Jiu,

32:50.210 --> 32:52.000
this is Guangping City.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.660
Guangping City?

33:16.000 --> 33:17.070
Why are you here?

33:17.480 --> 33:18.740
Do with me as you will.

33:18.860 --> 33:19.590
I won't tell you

33:19.590 --> 33:20.350
where he is.

33:21.660 --> 33:22.790
Commissioner Sima,

33:22.880 --> 33:24.410
what are you talking about?

33:26.480 --> 33:27.810
Don't you recognize me?

33:29.750 --> 33:31.950
I am Jiu Xuanye from the Ganshan Clinic.

33:32.590 --> 33:33.550
Physician Jiu?

33:35.510 --> 33:36.000
You...

34:01.870 --> 34:03.070
Xuanye, are you okay?

34:08.190 --> 34:09.110
Is... Is that you?

34:09.110 --> 34:10.110
Are you all right?

34:15.800 --> 34:16.480
It's me.

34:17.630 --> 34:18.489
What happened?

34:20.880 --> 34:22.010
I don't know either.

34:22.110 --> 34:23.219
You were acting so strange just now.

34:23.219 --> 34:24.960
It was like you became a different person.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.920
And you asked us

34:25.920 --> 34:28.110
if this was Shendu City or something.

34:31.070 --> 34:32.130
What else did I say?

34:33.280 --> 34:34.110
You said,

34:35.300 --> 34:36.360
"Tell him,

34:36.760 --> 34:38.760
I'll come and find him soon."

35:28.760 --> 35:29.230
What...

35:30.000 --> 35:31.660
What exactly do you want to do?

35:33.710 --> 35:34.970
Don't you remember me?

35:38.810 --> 35:40.070
The first time I saw you

35:40.760 --> 35:41.960
was ten years ago.

35:42.710 --> 35:44.170
You were still young then,

35:44.240 --> 35:45.320
just a child.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.930
But when you were playing the Qin,

35:48.070 --> 35:50.330
there was actually a touch of vividness.

35:51.470 --> 35:52.930
I happened to be passing by

35:53.070 --> 35:54.870
and was attracted by your music.

36:04.780 --> 36:05.580
Little snake,

36:05.770 --> 36:07.070
do you like Qin too?

36:12.670 --> 36:13.320
Kid,

36:13.550 --> 36:15.000
remember this in the future,

36:15.000 --> 36:16.480
the more colorful the snake,

36:16.480 --> 36:17.510
the more poisonous it is.

36:17.510 --> 36:18.150
In the future,

36:18.150 --> 36:19.480
don't get so close to it.

36:21.710 --> 36:23.150
Little snake...

36:29.090 --> 36:30.350
How is the catch today?

36:30.710 --> 36:31.590
Don't mention it.

36:31.590 --> 36:33.030
Just caught a small snake.

36:33.030 --> 36:34.890
I don't know how much it'll fetch.

36:35.850 --> 36:36.670
Alright, enjoy your meal.

36:36.670 --> 36:37.400
Okay, okay.

37:06.070 --> 37:07.200
Little snake, little snake.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.730
You should go home quickly.

37:08.760 --> 37:10.820
Don't get caught by bad people again.

37:12.950 --> 37:14.030
Go back.

37:21.800 --> 37:23.130
You showed me kindness.

37:24.240 --> 37:25.320
I should repay you.

37:27.010 --> 37:28.070
However, your wish

37:28.070 --> 37:29.330
is full of resentment.

37:29.590 --> 37:31.230
I shouldn't have helped you.

37:31.840 --> 37:32.710
But I've observed you

37:32.710 --> 37:33.800
for a long time.

37:34.230 --> 37:35.760
The actions of those people

37:36.510 --> 37:37.550
are indeed evil.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.090
You're drunk again.

37:50.320 --> 37:50.960
Get away!

37:53.000 --> 37:53.920
Be careful.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.640
Don't drink anymore.

37:55.740 --> 37:57.660
You annoying woman!

37:59.560 --> 38:01.480
I'll strangle you!

38:02.230 --> 38:02.880
Get away!

38:19.540 --> 38:20.880
Young lady.

38:24.440 --> 38:25.440
So,

38:26.470 --> 38:27.990
you killed my husband

38:28.010 --> 38:29.010
and Lv Sanlang?

38:31.000 --> 38:31.800
That's right.

38:55.560 --> 38:56.800
Since you brought me here,

38:56.800 --> 38:58.070
what on earth do you want to do?

38:58.070 --> 38:58.840
You once wished

38:58.840 --> 38:59.880
to be a man.

39:00.360 --> 39:01.710
Then you can no longer suffer

39:01.710 --> 39:04.110
the exclusion and prejudice in this world.

39:04.760 --> 39:05.400
Now,

39:06.360 --> 39:07.960
you can start all over again.

39:10.550 --> 39:12.350
This... This is a demonic spell?

39:13.070 --> 39:14.270
It's my snake slough.

39:15.150 --> 39:16.570
The snake slough can conceal one's true form

39:16.570 --> 39:17.880
and reshape one's appearance.

39:17.880 --> 39:19.590
That day, I cast a spell to fake your death,

39:19.590 --> 39:20.720
took away your body,

39:21.030 --> 39:23.000
and covered it with my snake slough.

39:23.000 --> 39:25.460
So you can now transform into my appearance.

39:29.720 --> 39:31.920
These are some travel expenses for you.

39:32.030 --> 39:33.070
You can leave now.

39:34.190 --> 39:35.650
Go wherever you want to go.

39:36.150 --> 39:37.810
Lead the life you want to live.

39:39.920 --> 39:40.510
Mr. Bai.

39:42.630 --> 39:43.150
Mr. Bai.

39:46.670 --> 39:47.710
Whether you're a demon

39:47.710 --> 39:48.710
or a human being,

39:49.190 --> 39:50.760
you're my savior.

39:52.710 --> 39:54.040
You're not afraid of me?

39:54.260 --> 39:55.580
You saved my life.

39:56.070 --> 39:57.760
How could I be afraid of you?

39:58.620 --> 39:59.810
Besides, I've long been accustomed to

39:59.810 --> 40:00.840
the cold realities of this world

40:00.840 --> 40:02.630
and the malicious nature of humans.

40:02.630 --> 40:03.550
Human beings

40:04.060 --> 40:06.120
are far more terrifying than demons.

40:11.030 --> 40:11.960
Mr. Bai,

40:13.440 --> 40:14.590
please take me in.

40:15.210 --> 40:16.770
Give me a place to stay.

40:22.970 --> 40:23.640
Mr. Bai.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.250
I can make your bed,

40:26.250 --> 40:27.910
wash clothes, and cook meals.

40:28.500 --> 40:29.730
As long as you ask,

40:29.760 --> 40:30.880
I can do anything.

40:31.110 --> 40:32.070
Since you've already gotten your wish

40:32.070 --> 40:33.150
and become a man,

40:33.710 --> 40:34.880
why do you still want to do these things

40:34.880 --> 40:36.340
that are about serving me?

40:42.710 --> 40:44.760
I'm all alone in this world,

40:46.000 --> 40:47.840
with no family to support

40:48.590 --> 40:50.670
and no friends to rely on.

40:52.090 --> 40:53.410
Although I've gotten my wish now

40:53.410 --> 40:54.410
and become a man,

40:56.110 --> 40:57.910
I have no skills to make a living.

41:00.690 --> 41:02.520
What can I do if I leave?

41:04.280 --> 41:06.480
Even if you give me more taels of silver,

41:06.480 --> 41:09.710
I'll just be eating away at the money without gaining income.

41:09.710 --> 41:10.400
Mr. Bai.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.880
I know you're a capable man.

41:16.850 --> 41:19.310
Please take me in and let me stay by your side.

41:24.260 --> 41:24.830
What?

41:25.630 --> 41:27.920
Sima Lingying has been captured by a demon?

41:27.920 --> 41:28.400
Yes.

41:29.160 --> 41:30.240
How do you know?

41:30.350 --> 41:30.880
Where is she?

41:30.880 --> 41:31.560
Is she hurt?

41:32.920 --> 41:34.520
It was too rushed at the time.

41:34.710 --> 41:37.110
I'm not sure about the specific situation.

41:37.110 --> 41:39.190
I only remember it was a dilapidated temple.

41:39.190 --> 41:40.590
It should be in the south.

41:40.840 --> 41:41.760
It's a place that's warmer

41:41.760 --> 41:43.000
than Guangping.

41:43.510 --> 41:44.670
Where exactly?

41:47.110 --> 41:48.840
That demon asked about Shendu.

41:49.320 --> 41:51.360
It's likely near Shendu City.

41:52.710 --> 41:53.280
Alright.

41:53.710 --> 41:55.570
I'll go ask the lord for leave now.

41:57.190 --> 41:58.400
Can you go with me?

41:59.840 --> 42:00.630
I can't.

42:01.670 --> 42:02.730
I have a feeling

42:03.400 --> 42:05.110
that he will come looking for me again.

42:05.110 --> 42:06.060
If I go,

42:06.360 --> 42:07.960
I'll only cause you trouble.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.000
Okay.

42:22.190 --> 42:23.400
Yes, that's it.

42:27.170 --> 42:28.090
You're back.

42:28.960 --> 42:32.220
Have you figured out the reason for last night's incident?

42:32.880 --> 42:33.680
It's nothing.

42:34.030 --> 42:34.890
I'll handle it.

42:35.230 --> 42:35.960
Don't worry.

42:37.840 --> 42:38.970
I'll get going then.

42:41.230 --> 42:42.430
You haven't paid yet.

42:50.320 --> 42:51.520
What did she just buy?

42:52.280 --> 42:54.190
She said not to tell you.

43:06.070 --> 43:06.800
My Lady,

43:07.110 --> 43:08.840
I was just about to look for you.

43:09.150 --> 43:09.760
Is he here?

43:11.400 --> 43:13.600
He's inside playing chess with Master.

43:18.630 --> 43:19.320
Perfect.
